    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mystery-horror game is about a classic alien invasion in the late 80s. Jones, a widowed reverend who lives alone on a secluded farmhouse, is forced to confront unsettling events following a family tragedy caused by a strange weather phenomenon. As mysterious events unfold, he must uncover the truth behind the growing terror, while struggling to survive the threat of extraterrestrials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/af776c6acabfc6ca8ab10d25d6c0804c.poster.avif?t=1732607727\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/af776c6acabfc6ca8ab10d25d6c0804c.webm?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/af776c6acabfc6ca8ab10d25d6c0804c.mp4?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE A CLASSIC ALIEN INVASION</strong><br>It\u2019s the late '80s in the countryside of the United States. The media buzzes with reports of strange weather phenomena and sightings of flying saucers\u2014dismissed by many as hoaxes. But no one should expect these mysteries to come creeping into their front yard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/916def3f59ea2c8bd2c5823ed44fc019.poster.avif?t=1732607727\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/916def3f59ea2c8bd2c5823ed44fc019.webm?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/916def3f59ea2c8bd2c5823ed44fc019.mp4?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INVESTIGATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues, gather weapons, and get ready to stand your ground against the Grays. You can lock your doors and be a coward, or go deep into the dark and rage, rage against the dying of the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/731c0265bba3ef99d7322bda527749c8.poster.avif?t=1732607727\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/731c0265bba3ef99d7322bda527749c8.webm?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/731c0265bba3ef99d7322bda527749c8.mp4?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Gameplay:</strong> Experience the story through Jones' eyes as you explore and survive the invasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation &amp; Exploration:</strong> Search the farmhouse and surrounding areas for clues, examine objects, and uncover hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting &amp; Melee Mechanics:</strong> Fight back against extraterrestrial threats using ranged weapons, alien technology, and melee weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health System:</strong> Keep an eye on your health as you battle extraterrestrial threats and endure the mental strain of the invasion. Manage injuries, stress, and stamina to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System:</strong> Collect and manage resources, weapons, and key items to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Gameplay:</strong> Sneak past or hide from alien enemies when combat isn\u2019t the best option.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware The Grays.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mystery-horror game is about a classic alien invasion in the late 80s. Jones, a widowed reverend who lives alone on a secluded farmhouse, is forced to confront unsettling events following a family tragedy caused by a strange weather phenomenon. As mysterious events unfold, he must uncover the truth behind the growing terror, while struggling to survive the threat of extraterrestrials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/af776c6acabfc6ca8ab10d25d6c0804c.poster.avif?t=1732607727\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/af776c6acabfc6ca8ab10d25d6c0804c.webm?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/af776c6acabfc6ca8ab10d25d6c0804c.mp4?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE A CLASSIC ALIEN INVASION</strong><br>It\u2019s the late '80s in the countryside of the United States. The media buzzes with reports of strange weather phenomena and sightings of flying saucers\u2014dismissed by many as hoaxes. But no one should expect these mysteries to come creeping into their front yard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/916def3f59ea2c8bd2c5823ed44fc019.poster.avif?t=1732607727\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/916def3f59ea2c8bd2c5823ed44fc019.webm?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/916def3f59ea2c8bd2c5823ed44fc019.mp4?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INVESTIGATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues, gather weapons, and get ready to stand your ground against the Grays. You can lock your doors and be a coward, or go deep into the dark and rage, rage against the dying of the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/731c0265bba3ef99d7322bda527749c8.poster.avif?t=1732607727\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/731c0265bba3ef99d7322bda527749c8.webm?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338880/extras/731c0265bba3ef99d7322bda527749c8.mp4?t=1732607727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Gameplay:</strong> Experience the story through Jones' eyes as you explore and survive the invasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation &amp; Exploration:</strong> Search the farmhouse and surrounding areas for clues, examine objects, and uncover hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting &amp; Melee Mechanics:</strong> Fight back against extraterrestrial threats using ranged weapons, alien technology, and melee weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health System:</strong> Keep an eye on your health as you battle extraterrestrial threats and endure the mental strain of the invasion. Manage injuries, stress, and stamina to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System:</strong> Collect and manage resources, weapons, and key items to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Gameplay:</strong> Sneak past or hide from alien enemies when combat isn\u2019t the best option.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware The Grays.</p>",
